  "description": "Time to buy...or.....",
  "body_html": "<p>We are seeing tons of significant bounces upward in the market this morning. Some of our positions jumping 10%, one of them up 20% this market open…So I am optimistic. But we need to see those prices <strong>HOLD. </strong></p><p>My <em><strong>speculation</strong></em> is the market will recover and continue its trajectory upwards. I said it in the video, and I will put it in bold here:</p><h4>WE ARE IN A BULL MARKET. </h4><p>However, the past roughly 2 months, we have not seen “pocket aces” positions win (watch the short video if you have no idea what I am talking about here.) </p><p>When we see the following…</p><ul><li><p>VIX break below 21, and hold</p></li><li><p>S&amp;P 500 break out of the range of death</p></li><li><p>A sector break out and/or bear get royally f&amp;$ked in short squeezes in a stock </p></li></ul><p>… then I will resume Mid-Week movers. </p><p>When I blab my fat mouth on the internet, and give you a stock pick, its because I think the odds are heavily in your favor of having a winning hand. When we are unsure, or what are normally “winning hands”, are not winning: I shut up and wait for them to work. </p><h4>I do not bet on my speculations…I bet on confirmations and performance. </h4><p>If you are looking for something more steady with out all the “trading” worries, check out the<strong> <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-etf-20?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok ETF 2.0</a>.</strong> The original has tripled the performance of the S&amp;P 500, and this new version has already started pulling away. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!8elq!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6a2a9a7b-b558-4239-9985-418c040c9dfc_878x815.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!8elq!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6a2a9a7b-b558-4239-9985-418c040c9dfc_878x815.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!8elq!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6a2a9a7b-b558-4239-9985-418c040c9dfc_878x815.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!8elq!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6a2a9a7b-b558-4239-9985-418c040c9dfc_878x815.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!8elq!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6a2a9a7b-b558-4239-9985-418c040c9dfc_878x815.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!8elq!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6a2a9a7b-b558-4239-9985-418c040c9dfc_878x815.png\" width=\"878\" height=\"815\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/6a2a9a7b-b558-4239-9985-418c040c9dfc_878x815.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:815,&quot;width&quot;:878,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:62396,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/209117444?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6a2a9a7b-b558-4239-9985-418c040c9dfc_878x815.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\